  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Digital transparency </h3> <h1> Add-on »z.Shopfloor« </h1>",
   "body": "<p>ZOLLER TMS with the <strong>add-on »z.Shopfloor«</strong> brings clear structure to manufacturing: The order management system provides correct tool and setup information at all times, while the order management service seamlessly establishes a connection between planning and the shop floor. The digital resharpening process provides full transparency into every rework operation, and tool life management ensures predictable tool availability – supplemented, if desired, by the optional »flash« monitoring system for early detection of critical tool conditions. This creates a seamless, efficient tool lifecycle directly on the shop floor.</p> <p><a class=\"btn\" href=\"/tr/company/contact\">Request now</a> <a href=\"https://myzoller.com/us/en/expert/booking/\" rel=\"noopener\" target=\"_blank\">1:1 expert meeting</a></p>",
   "images": [
    {
     "src": "/fileadmin/_processed_/2/e/csm_zShopfloor_product_85dc8b81e7.webp",
     "alt": "",
     "w": 1080,
