  {
   "type": "textmedia",
   "header": "<h3> Add-on »z.Shopfloor« </h3> <h2> Process reliability </h2>",
   "body": "<p class=\"large-text\">With this add-on, orders and tool conditions are visible in real time at all times. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">The add-on provides complete transparency throughout the process through paperless feedback. </p> <p class=\"large-text\">The add-on standardizes workflows, speeds up onboarding, and efficiently reduces employee workload.</p>",
